/*
 * Localized display names for the engineer-applied personal-equipment modifications.
 *
 * Source: the in-game modification localisation tables.
 *
 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * known gaps: data/i18n/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * `nameKeys` maps every recipe symbol data/equipment/modifications.jsonc carries to a
 * shared localized-name record. A record key is the modification entry the game
 * publishes, which is the recipe symbol with any technology suffix dropped: the game
 * offers Greater Range, Headshot Damage and Improved Hip Fire Accuracy as one option
 * each, so the nine Kinetic, Laser and Plasma recipes this repository keys separately
 * resolve to three records rather than nine. Each record carries the canonical English
 * display name, which the owning modifications catalogue remains authoritative for, and
 * the five other locales the source publishes.
 */
